  (#("1 HOW TO BUILD A UNIVERSE" 0 1 (pdf-text-emph bold) 2 25 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11909 0.42936 0.18395 0.20233 0.20233 0.01578 0.00504 0.3845 0.0118 "KOPNJF+TimesNewRoman,Bold" 0.0143 t nil 0 "KOPNJF+TimesNewRoman,Bold" t)
  ("NO MATTER HOW hard you try you will never be able to grasp just how tiny, how spatially" 0.11909 0.88139 0.21932 0.2351 0.2351 0.01578 0.00504 0.3714 0.0291 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("unassuming, is a proton. It is just way too small." 0.11909 0.50895 0.23578 0.25156 0.25156 0.01578 0.00504 0.3542 0.1014 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("A proton is an infinitesimal part of an atom, which is itself of course an insubstantial thing." 0.13926 0.88159 0.26877 0.28455 0.28455 0.01578 0.00504 0.3184 0.0146 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  (#("Protons are so small that a little dib of ink like the dot on this i can hold something in the" 67 69 (pdf-text-emph italic)) 0.11909 0.8813 0.28516 0.30094 0.30094 0.01578 0.00504 0.2557 0.0618 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("region of 500,000,000,000 of them, rather more than the number of seconds contained in half" 0.11909 0.88156 0.30155 0.31733 0.31733 0.01578 0.00504 0.2800 0.0515 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("a million years. So protons are exceedingly microscopic, to say the very least." 0.11909 0.74697 0.31801 0.33379 0.33379 0.01578 0.00504 0.2981 0.0089 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("Now imagine if you can (and of course you can’t) shrinking one of those protons down to a" 0.13926 0.88149 0.35094 0.36671 0.36671 0.01578 0.00504 0.2994 0.0392 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("billionth of its normal size into a space so small that it would make a proton look enormous." 0.11909 0.88155 0.36732 0.3831 0.3831 0.01578 0.00504 0.3051 0.0685 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("Now pack into that tiny, tiny space about an ounce of matter. Excellent. You are ready to start" 0.11909 0.88144 0.38371 0.39949 0.39949 0.01578 0.00504 0.3125 0.0392 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("a universe." 0.11909 0.20653 0.40018 0.41595 0.41595 0.01578 0.00504 0.2419 0.0089 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("I’m assuming of course that you wish to build an inflationary universe. If you’d prefer" 0.13926 0.88147 0.4331 0.44887 0.44887 0.01578 0.00504 0.2535 0.0291 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("instead to build a more old-fashioned, standard Big Bang universe, you’ll need additional" 0.11909 0.88138 0.44949 0.46526 0.46526 0.01578 0.00504 0.2334 0.0571 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("materials. In fact, you will need to gather up everything there is every last mote and particle of" 0.11909 0.88161 0.46588 0.48165 0.48165 0.01578 0.00504 0.3100 0.0789 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("matter between here and the edge of creation and squeeze it into a spot so infinitesimally" 0.11909 0.88157 0.48227 0.49804 0.49804 0.01578 0.00504 0.2387 0.0514 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("compact that it has no dimensions at all. It is known as a singularity." 0.11909 0.67085 0.49873 0.5145 0.5145 0.01578 0.00504 0.3306 0.0682 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("In either case, get ready for a really big bang. Naturally, you will wish to retire to a safe" 0.13924 0.88149 0.53165 0.54742 0.54742 0.01578 0.00504 0.2668 0.0168 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("place to observe the spectacle. Unfortunately, there is nowhere to retire to because outside the" 0.11909 0.88143 0.54804 0.56381 0.56381 0.01578 0.00504 0.2673 0.0426 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  (#("singularity there is no where. When the universe begins to expand, it won’t be spreading out" 24 29 (pdf-text-emph italic)) 0.11909 0.88152 0.56443 0.5802 0.5802 0.01578 0.00504 0.2782 0.0863 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("to fill a larger emptiness. The only space that exists is the space it creates as it goes." 0.11909 0.79411 0.58089 0.59666 0.59666 0.01578 0.00504 0.2880 0.0157 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("It is natural but wrong to visualize the singularity as a kind of pregnant dot hanging in a" 0.13926 0.88142 0.61388 0.62966 0.62966 0.01578 0.00504 0.2422 0.0123 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("dark, boundless void. But there is no space, no darkness. The singularity has no “around”" 0.11909 0.88155 0.63027 0.64605 0.64605 0.01578 0.00504 0.2023 0.0409 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("around it. There is no space for it to occupy, no place for it to be. We can’t even ask how long" 0.11909 0.88162 0.64666 0.66244 0.66244 0.01578 0.00504 0.3125 0.0561 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("it has been there—whether it has just lately popped into being, like a good idea, or whether it" 0.11909 0.88147 0.66305 0.67883 0.67883 0.01578 0.00504 0.3129 0.0112 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("has been there forever, quietly awaiting the right moment. Time doesn’t exist. There is no past" 0.11909 0.88137 0.67944 0.69521 0.69521 0.01578 0.00504 0.3237 0.0269 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("for it to emerge from." 0.11909 0.29316 0.6959 0.71168 0.71168 0.01578 0.00504 0.3880 0.0235 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("And so, from nothing, our universe begins." 0.13926 0.48606 0.72889 0.74467 0.74467 0.01578 0.00504 0.3306 0.0347 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("In a single blinding pulse, a moment of glory much too swift and expansive for any form of" 0.13926 0.88154 0.76181 0.77759 0.77759 0.01578 0.00504 0.3307 0.0168 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("words, the singularity assumes heavenly dimensions, space beyond conception. In the first" 0.11909 0.88155 0.7782 0.79398 0.79398 0.01578 0.00504 0.2406 0.0544 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("lively second (a second that many cosmologists will devote careers to shaving into ever-finer" 0.11909 0.88132 0.79459 0.81037 0.81037 0.01578 0.00504 0.2688 0.0460 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("wafers) is produced gravity and the other forces that govern physics. In less than a minute the" 0.11909 0.88145 0.81098 0.82676 0.82676 0.01578 0.00504 0.2667 0.0605 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("universe is a million billion miles across and growing fast. There is a lot of heat now, ten" 0.11909 0.88148 0.82737 0.84315 0.84315 0.01578 0.00504 0.2692 0.0685 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("billion degrees of it, enough to begin the nuclear reactions that create the lighter elements—" 0.11909 0.88143 0.84376 0.85954 0.85954 0.01578 0.00504 0.2462 0.0527 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("principally hydrogen and helium, with a dash (about one atom in a hundred million) of" 0.11909 0.88163 0.86015 0.87593 0.87593 0.01578 0.00504 0.2486 0.0875 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("lithium. In three minutes, 98 percent of all the matter there is or will ever be has been" 0.11909 0.88168 0.87654 0.89232 0.89232 0.01578 0.00504 0.2621 0.0632 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("produced. We have a universe. It is a place of the most wondrous and gratifying possibility," 0.11909 0.88145 0.89293 0.90871 0.90871 0.01578 0.00504 0.2827 0.0802 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("and beautiful, too. And it was all done in about the time it takes to make a sandwich." 0.11909 0.80143 0.90939 0.92517 0.92517 0.01578 0.00504 0.3434 0.0291 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
