  ("When this moment happened is a matter of some debate. Cosmologists have long argued" 0.13936 0.8814 0.08457 0.10035 0.10035 0.01578 0.00504 0.3076 0.0480 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
