  (#("came the moment known to science as t = 0. We were on our way." 36 38 (pdf-text-emph italic)) 0.11909 0.65464 0.16659 0.18237 0.18237 0.01578 0.00504 0.3761 0.0424 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("There is of course a great deal we don’t know, and much of what we think we know we" 0.13924 0.88151 0.19951 0.21529 0.21529 0.01578 0.00504 0.2883 0.0471 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("haven’t known, or thought we’ve known, for long. Even the notion of the Big Bang is quite a" 0.11909 0.88143 0.2159 0.23168 0.23168 0.01578 0.00504 0.2960 0.0605 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
