  ("Belgian priest-scholar, first tentatively proposed it, but it didn’t really become an active" 0.11909 0.88142 0.24868 0.26446 0.26446 0.01578 0.00504 0.2487 0.0628 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
