  ("Their names were Arno Penzias and Robert Wilson. In 1965, they were trying to make use" 0.13927 0.88128 0.31445 0.33023 0.33023 0.01578 0.00504 0.3321 0.0437 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
