  ("commonly as bird shit. Nothing they tried worked." 0.11909 0.52746 0.47842 0.49419 0.49419 0.01578 0.00504 0.3485 0.0863 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
