  ("According to Guth’s theory, at one ten-millionth of a trillionth of a trillionth of a trillionth" 0.13926 0.88143 0.36362 0.3794 0.3794 0.01578 0.00504 0.3035 0.0851 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("of a second, gravity emerged. After another ludicrously brief interval it was joined by" 0.11909 0.88146 0.38001 0.39579 0.39579 0.01578 0.00504 0.2507 0.0168 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("electromagnetism and the strong and weak nuclear forces—the stuff of physics. These were" 0.11909 0.88142 0.3964 0.41218 0.41218 0.01578 0.00504 0.2848 0.1432 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
