  ("Martin Rees, Britain’s astronomer royal, believes that there are many universes, possibly an" 0.13939 0.88149 0.20001 0.21579 0.21579 0.01578 0.00504 0.3260 0.0549 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
