  ("live in one that combines things in the way that allows us to exist. He makes an analogy with" 0.11909 0.88146 0.23279 0.24857 0.24857 0.01578 0.00504 0.3175 0.0303 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
  ("a very large clothing store: “If there is a large stock of clothing, you’re not surprised to find a" 0.11909 0.88152 0.24918 0.26495 0.26495 0.01578 0.00504 0.2462 0.0089 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
