  ("will be one where there is a particular set of numbers suitable to life. We are in that one.”" 0.11909 0.83946 0.28203 0.2978 0.2978 0.01578 0.00504 0.3404 0.0314 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
