  ("values were changed even very slightly things could not be as they are. For example, for the" 0.11909 0.88153 0.33134 0.34712 0.34712 0.01578 0.00504 0.2492 0.0516 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
