  ("comparatively stately manner—specifically, in a way that converts seven one-thousandths of" 0.11909 0.88131 0.36412 0.37989 0.37989 0.01578 0.00504 0.2939 0.1153 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
