  (#("I should say that everything is just right so far. In the long term, gravity may turn out to be a" 43 49 (pdf-text-emph italic)) 0.11909 0.88138 0.51205 0.52783 0.52783 0.01578 0.00504 0.2828 0.0067 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
