  ("Now the question that has occurred to all of us at some point is: what would happen if you" 0.13929 0.88154 0.70901 0.72479 0.72479 0.01578 0.00504 0.3094 0.0392 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
