  ("The answer, disappointingly, is that you can never get to the edge of the universe. That’s not" 0.11909 0.88133 0.75818 0.77396 0.77396 0.01578 0.00504 0.2565 0.0314 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" 0.0143 nil nil 0 "KOPLLM+TimesNewRoman" nil)
